o-ascii-font-family: "Microsoft Yahei"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Microsoft Yahei"; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt'><FONT face=宋体>更</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Microsoft Yahei","serif"; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt'>”</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Microsoft Yahei"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Microsoft Yahei"; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt'><FONT face=宋体>字的增加表明，这是在过去基础上对教育提出的一项新要求，要再进一步发展公平而有质量的教育。同时，这也可能会意味着，新一年将出台更多更加强有力的政策，在此前教育部公布的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Microsoft Yahei","serif"; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt'>2019</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Microsoft Yahei"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Microsoft Yahei"; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt'>年工作要点中也有相关体现。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Microsoft Yahei","serif"; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
